&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Global Alliance Director - Accenture to join our Global GSI Advisory Team. This is a role based in the Americas, reporting to the Senior Director, Alliance Partners. You will lead the end-to-end Global Partnership with Accenture, building key relationships and developing joint offerings that drive transformational, incremental net new opportunities for Zscaler. You will serve as the primary architect for our global Accenture business plan, ensuring mutual revenue growth and strategic alignment across our Security, Network, and Cloud practices.&lt;/p&gt;
