&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to build pipelines for technical, product, or engineering-adjacent roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of passive candidate engagement and long-cycle sourcing strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Natural curiosity and the ability to quickly learn new domains and translate that knowledge into effective talent assessments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with the ability to influence and advise recruiters and hiring managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent prioritization and self-management skills, with the ability to operate independently in a dynamic environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working collaboratively across teams and time zones while maintaining strong communication and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
