&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Employment is contingent on passing a background check. Additionally, some roles require passing a drug test, depending on the job responsibilities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

