&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At NiCE, we don’t limit our challenges. We challenge our limits. Always. We’re ambitious. We’re game changers. And we play to win. We set the highest standards and execute beyond them. And if you’re like us, we can offer you the ultimate career opportunity that will light a fire within you.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What&#39;s the Role All About?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Software Engineer &lt;/strong&gt;is a customer-facing, billable role responsible for implementing, configuring, and delivering AI-driven and Conversational AI solutions across the NICE CXone ecosystem.&amp;nbsp; As a hands-on technical contributor, you will build integrations, configure conversational AI platforms, and ensure high-quality execution of project deliverables.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How Will You Make an Impact?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with business stakeholders to map current workflows, identify ROI-backed opportunities (reduced effort, improved employee experience, measurable efficiency gains), and define future-state toAI-enabled processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, build, and iterate AI solutions and automations in n8n, Copilot Studio, and other AI/automation tools; create reliable agents and assistants that remove manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and work within NiCE internal processes and systems (e.g., CRMs, knowledge bases, ticketing/support tools, and operational platforms) to ensure solutions fit real-world constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with IT and Developers when needed to overcome technical obstacles, integrate securely with enterprise systems, and scale solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable and upskill internal support teams to use AI effectively—through reusable patterns, playbooks, coaching, and hands-on problem solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain expertise in modern AI approaches and apply them pragmatically to internal operations, including LLMs, RAG, GPT-based assistants, Copilot ecosystems, MCP servers, APIs, JSON, and light scripting. Use AI tools to debug and resolve workflow or code errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have You Got What It Takes?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in solutioning, business process improvement, operations consulting, or similar roles driving cross-functional change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to translate operational needs into practical AI use cases and deliver outcomes against clear success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong, applied knowledge of AI and NLP technologies (LLMs, RAG, GPTs, Copilot-style assistants, AI agent patterns, MCP servers).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building automations/assistants with n8n (or comparable orchestration tools); comfort developing in Copilot Studio or similar platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of API integrations, JSON, and basic coding/scripting; able to use AI tools to debug and manipulate code or automation errors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated curiosity and ongoing personal or professional use of AI tools to improve workflows—someone who experiments, learns fast, and brings practical AI habits into the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management and communication skills, with the ability to drive adoption and help others become effective with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating in a fast-paced environment, balancing multiple initiatives and iterating quickly based on feedback and results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What’s in it for you?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join an ever-growing, market disrupting, global company where the teams – comprised of the best of the best – work in a fast-paced, collaborative, and creative environment! As the market leader, every day at NiCE is a chance to learn and grow, and there are endless internal career opportunities across multiple roles, disciplines, domains, and locations. If you are passionate, innovative, and excited to constantly raise the bar, you may just be our next NiCEr!&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
